{"pageProps":{"lesson":{"day":15,"title":"Day 15: Giving an opinion — SpeakSprint","heading":"Giving an opinion","kicker":"DAY 15 · 30 MINUTES · 6 SESSIONS / WEEK","description":"Nêu quan điểm đơn giản và lịch sự.","contentVersion":2,"answers":{"comp":"a|b|a","quiz":"a|b"},"sections":[{"id":"mission","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Give your opinion about remote or office work. Speak for <b>120 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"},{"id":"weekly-baseline","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">BEFORE PRACTICE · 1 MIN</span><p class=\"instruction\">Làm bài nói đầu tuần trước khi đọc bài và xem ví dụ. Ghi lại những gì bạn tự nói được.</p><div class=\"weekly-check\"><h3>Weekly baseline</h3><p>Repeat this same 60-second task at the beginning and end of the week: <b>Recommend one change at work and give a reason and an example.</b></p><p class=\"instruction\">Làm riêng với bài nói chính nếu thời lượng khác. Tự đếm số lần dừng lâu hơn 3 giây; không suy ra độ chính xác từ thời lượng.</p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\">Actual baseline speaking seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\">Pauses longer than 3 seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\">Target chunks used (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\">Chunks recalled without help (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\">A recurring error to work on:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\"><p id=\"weekly-comparison\" role=\"status\"></p></div>"},{"id":"warmup","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 14 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Identify who or what is affected. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"It affects customers who use the payment page.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 12 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Check the condition in which a problem occurs. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Does it happen when you use another browser?\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 8 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Say when a problem was first observed. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We first noticed it this morning during testing.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 1 · ôn sau 14 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Explain how you contribute to the team. <small>Answer as if a colleague has just asked you.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I help our team release useful features.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"reading","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">We're discussing how often to work in the office. I think two office days each week are useful. In my opinion, we can solve difficult questions faster when we're together. From my point of view, we also need quiet time. I prefer working at home because I can focus on testing. For me, a clear plan matters more than the place. We use chat to ask quick questions, and I share updates with my team. One option is to try two office days for a month. After that, we can ask everyone what worked well.</div>"},{"id":"comprehension","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"comp","label":"COMPREHENSION · 3 MIN","heading":"Check the message","hint":"Look for who, what happened, and why the speaker says it.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. What is the speaker giving an opinion about?","choices":[{"text":" Office and home working","name":"comp-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp1"},{"text":" A new testing tool","name":"comp-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Why does the speaker like working at home?","choices":[{"text":" There are more meetings","name":"comp-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp2"},{"text":" It helps them focus","name":"comp-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp2"}]},{"prompt":"3. Why suggest a one-month trial?","choices":[{"text":" To learn what works for the team","name":"comp-3","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp3"},{"text":" To make a permanent decision immediately","name":"comp-3","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp3"}]}]},{"id":"chunks","className":"panel","type":"chunks","label":"CHUNKS · 5 MIN","heading":"Five chunks to use today","instruction":"Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.","items":[{"label":"1/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"I think…","meaning":"Tôi nghĩ…","details":["Give a simple opinion in a team discussion.","I think + clause","I think this is useful.","I think two office days a week are enough."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-1"},{"label":"2/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"In my opinion…","meaning":"Theo ý kiến của tôi…","details":["Make it clear you are sharing an opinion.","In my opinion, + clause","In my opinion, this works well.","In my opinion, remote work helps me focus."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-2"},{"label":"3/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"From my point of view…","meaning":"Từ góc nhìn của tôi…","details":["Explain how you see the situation.","From my point of view, + clause","From my point of view, it's fair.","From my point of view, the team needs more quiet time."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-3"},{"label":"4/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"I prefer… because…","meaning":"Tôi thích… hơn vì…","details":["State a preference and give a reason.","I prefer + noun / verb-ing + because + clause","I prefer chat because it's quick.","I prefer working at home because I can focus."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-4"},{"label":"5/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"For me…","meaning":"Với tôi…","details":["Explain what matters to you personally.","For me, + clause","For me, the price matters.","For me, a quiet place is important for difficult tasks."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-5"}]},{"id":"variation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. I think…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: short meetings help the team.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. In my opinion…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: the new design is easier to use.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. From my point of view…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: the plan needs more testing.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. I prefer… because…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: short meetings / they save time.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. For me…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: clear instructions are important.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"},{"id":"rapid-recall","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Give a simple opinion in a team discussion. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I think two office days a week are enough.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Make it clear you are sharing an opinion. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"In my opinion, remote work helps me focus.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain how you see the situation. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"From my point of view, the team needs more quiet time.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>State a preference and give a reason. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I prefer working at home because I can focus.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain what matters to you personally. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"For me, a quiet place is important for difficult tasks.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Describe the first action in your investigation. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"First, I made a copy of the settings.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"speaking","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">I think this is useful. /<br>In my opinion, this works well. /<br>From my point of view, it's fair.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Give your opinion about remote or office work.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"},{"id":"conversation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What would you recommend?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>Why do you prefer that option?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>Can you give me an example?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What concern should we consider?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"},{"id":"quiz","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"quiz","label":"END CHECK · 2 MIN","heading":"Choose a useful chunk","hint":"Think about the situation where you would use the phrase.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. Which chunk means “Tôi nghĩ…”?","choices":[{"text":" I think…","name":"quiz-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"},{"text":" I prefer… because…","name":"quiz-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Which chunk means “Với tôi…”?","choices":[{"text":" In my opinion…","name":"quiz-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"},{"text":" For me…","name":"quiz-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"}]}]},{"id":"daily-progress","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">REVIEW · 2 MIN</span><h2>Today's progress</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Các số về nói và nhớ chunk là tự đánh giá; số câu đọc hiểu lấy từ lần nộp gần nhất. Chưa nhập nghĩa là chưa có dữ liệu.</p><p id=\"chunk-progress\" role=\"status\"></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-seconds\">Actual speaking time (seconds):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-improvement\">One thing I can do better now:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-improvement\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-improvement\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-next\">Tomorrow, one small thing I will practise:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-next\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-next\">"}],"completionText":"Hoàn thành đọc hiểu, kể lần một, quiz và các bước Recall → Think → đối chiếu → kể lần hai. Nhiều bài trong cùng ngày chỉ tính một ngày streak.","navigation":[{"href":"../index.html","text":"← Dashboard"},{"href":"day-16.html","text":"Day 16 →"}]},"pageType":"lesson"},"__N_SSG":true}